pkcs11-proxy (0.4-1ubuntu2) precise; urgency=low

  * Support IPv6 and connect-fallback through getaddrinfo()
  * Implement TLS-PSK using OpenSSL
  * Use libseccomp and reduce number of syscalls allowed in dispatchers
  * Several important bug fixes (now passes SoftHSM test suite)

